@startuml SessionLayerSequence

participant "EchoClientHelper2" as EchoClientHelper2
participant "MyStreamSocket" as MyStreamSocket
participant "EchoServerThread" as EchoServerThread

EchoClientHelper2 -> MyStreamSocket: sendMessage("LOGIN t00224519 mypassword")
MyStreamSocket -> EchoServerThread: Writes message to socket output stream
EchoServerThread -> EchoServerThread: Reads message using BufferedReader
EchoServerThread -> EchoServerThread: Processes LOGIN request
EchoServerThread -> MyStreamSocket: Writes "101 LOGIN SUCCESS" using PrintWriter
MyStreamSocket -> EchoClientHelper2: receiveMessage() reads response
EchoClientHelper2 -> EchoClientHelper2: Returns "101 LOGIN SUCCESS"

@enduml